{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_1000_p", "source_sha256": "933dbeee58327627340b028524a7c0e0d1858c6e87d404e044064d549356fd24", "ja": "（今日はウェディング雑誌の撮影だ。早く着いたので\n瑞希と一緒に、現場の見学をしている……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄婚礼杂志。因为提前到了，所以正在和瑞希一起参观拍摄现场……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "12063ca026e5b58970c892d9c1436f7b71b092b54291fb4fc4bbc4d761833ad5", "ja": "うーん…………これは難問だぞ。", "zh": "嗯…………这可真是个难题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_1002_p", "source_sha256": "08a0c45b20153d56c9e8d92c032e259007cf692131cec0b567ca3a5ebc554fbc", "ja": "どうしたんだ、瑞希？\nそんなに難しい顔して。", "zh": "怎么了，瑞希？\n表情怎么这么严肃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "e22a443bb508884a0c39535a92783275594ee8961135b84af6b497f4dc8f6e4a", "ja": "……{$P$}、結婚式に向かう\n花嫁さんとは、どんな気持ちなのでしょうか？", "zh": "……{$P$}，奔赴婚礼的\n新娘，究竟会是怎样的心情呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "1714ed1ec7dae31f8f9c3dab8b7e132285925f59e442576aeed64e63c8ff94fc", "ja": "花嫁さんにとって、結婚式は大切なイベントです。\nだから、特別な気持ちになっているとは思うのですが。", "zh": "对新娘来说，婚礼是很重要的活动。\n所以，我想她一定会有一种特别的心情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3fbc5f418a014d595092d251194ef58a138c72afa4241722aaabc68dd1f98707", "ja": "花嫁さんの気持ちか……。せっかく教会にいるんだ。\n少し結婚式のマネでもしてみるか？", "zh": "新娘的心情吗……难得来到了教堂。要不要稍微模仿一下婚礼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "be5821b6ac31443987ccc79b25cfbdd291617e56f51df370167e7d1ed4541579", "ja": "なるほど。実際に体験してみるということですね。\n頭で考えるよりはいいかもしれません。……それでは。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，要亲自体验一下。\n或许比光在脑海里想象要好。……那么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "4ea1701d9fa8aad1d7163984e4ea49302cbea556e44db374b3ba2c8206588d85", "ja": "……コホン。新郎{$P$}、あなたは\n真壁瑞希を、健やかなるときも、病めるときも……。", "zh": "……咳咳。新郎{$P$}，你愿意无论健康还是患病，都和真壁瑞希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "0cb073cee7a6f26e619e230ca735bf9da344e85807cda52fae811f1ac67a6868", "ja": "共に過ごし、愛をもって……\n互いに支えあうことを、誓いますか？　……ドキドキ。", "zh": "无论健康还是患病，都愿意与她共度时光，用爱彼此扶持……你愿意发誓吗？……好紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_1010", "source_sha256": "70374a96c7e8d5f4abfc335c63fc27c83d9f0405f62e2badfc50a48da0367d36", "ja": "誓います", "zh": "我发誓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_2000_p", "source_sha256": "9e194a798d1d33d34a9bcffc3e52e9bf64325f8380d8324d26d57ff02aea9951", "ja": "はい、誓いま……あれ？　これ、逆じゃないか？", "zh": "是，发誓……咦？这不是反了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_2001_044miz", "source_sha256": "8a3e9fe932e6b80c3f230f222d73aab6b654cf40038ee1a1f72061302ffb0d14", "ja": "……なんと。気づいてしまいましたか、\n{$P$}……作戦失敗だぞ。", "zh": "……居然被你发现了，\n{$P$}……作战失败了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_2002_p", "source_sha256": "a26c09d2e3f602cf0fde0295499f2c38b85d7b22a861c63613271d10380fef89", "ja": "作戦？", "zh": "作战？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_2003_044miz", "source_sha256": "b63a041aed3a4afc94436816b81c04da793301a95635075c6a9e07fc861703e0", "ja": "こちらの話ですので、気にしないでください。\nそれより体験の成果は絶大ですね。", "zh": "是我自言自语，请不用在意。\n比起那个，体验的成果非同凡响呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_2004_044miz", "source_sha256": "6cd445d84d3509db66edb98d5b5576715594be13fd66d787f315249aa428427c", "ja": "花嫁さんの気持ちが、少しだけわかった気がします。\nそれに、結婚式が特別だという意味も……。", "zh": "我觉得，自己稍微理解了一点新娘的心情。\n还有，婚礼之所以特别的意义……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_2005_p", "source_sha256": "3d0041c3a5356eb7ea89b69ca29e3e13b5c86fabe9380ee005565127c4e54d63", "ja": "えっ？　そ、そうか……。\nまあ、瑞希の役に立ったならよかったよ。", "zh": "诶？这、这样啊……\n嗯，只要能帮上瑞希的忙就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_2006_044miz", "source_sha256": "e8d15b4a48ddbdfc76c54b2ce3253058f7e06ba871f909af0d25cc46b59e4787", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます。\nこれで安心して、撮影に臨めそうです。", "zh": "是的，谢谢您。\n这样一来，我就能安心地面对拍摄了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0393_2007_044miz", "source_sha256": "a8c53d52da7c4385b502b23e33f2d9144bb24ca089270b786175d9fb019bffd4", "ja": "……このドキドキは、まだ心の奥に。\nでもいつか続きができたら……。ふふっ。", "zh": "……这份心跳，还在内心深处。\n但要是以后能有后续的话……。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
